  "description": "ZOYSUF crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2. Reported CIF formula moiety: C127 H110 Dy6 N30 O27,5(C4 H9 N1 O1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.907-4.859 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.60-178.32°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(CO3)(D-Pro)6(L_Schiff)4(HL_Schiff)2]·5DMA·2H2O.",
